  "ingredients": [
    "6 eggs",
    "1 pound bacon",
    "2 bunches fresh spinach, rinsed and dried",
    "4 green onions, thinly sliced",
    "2 eggs",
    "0.25 cup white sugar",
    "0.25 cup white vinegar",
    "0.25 cup red wine vinegar"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WPYvtpH8QpqkcVuNCgHmmXbwUqc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25165-wilted-spinich-salad-DDMFS-Step-01-82d04662be2e4f23b8c26ff75d238418.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25165/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place 6 eggs in a medium saucepan with enough cold water to cover. Bring water to a boil, and immediately remove from heat. Cover, and let eggs stand in hot water for 10 to 12 minutes. Remove from hot water, cool, peel, and chop.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ZiwbqXUYrLrRMy2XyqNEN27Ux28=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25165-wilted-spinich-salad-DDMFS-Step-02-4705111d71fd44aaa928669205277ed1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25165/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place bacon in a large, deep skillet. Cook over medium high heat until evenly brown. Drain, crumble, and set aside, reserving approximately 1/2 cup of drippings in the skillet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/r75Eq0KsxBHaNyPzrmXRVvBoa9c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25165-wilted-spinich-salad-DDMFS-Step-03-6f6f9bac243047dfb9b41ab3da161b21.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25165/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Toss spinach and green onions together in a large bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pTThGI2WtftKnvZOPEXKedlGxTI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25165-wilted-spinich-salad-DDMFS-Step-04-a234ff0646c242b8b03e22fa03eccfca.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25165/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat the reserved drippings over low heat. Whisk 2 remaining eggs, sugar, white vinegar, and red wine vinegar together in a small bowl; add to warm drippings and whisk until thickened, about 1 minute.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ZKyHt1hB8-3gvKXp8oggfYTpBjM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25165-wilted-spinich-salad-DDMFS-Step-05-fa2c25846e1247af8c7c3a62c97c3448.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25165/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour warm dressing over spinach; add crumbled bacon and toss to coat. Garnish with chopped egg.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nnrsQB3qRoEmsJQsLUvqamPSfkQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25165-wilted-spinich-salad-DDMFS-Step-06-9f736e89cece472faa816e49e0f9306b.jpg"
      ],
